			"notes": "## Safe Offhand 1.1.0\n\n### Multi-version support\n\nSafe Offhand now supports Minecraft versions from **1.21.8 through 26.3** using a Stonecutter-based multi-version setup.\n\nSupported versions:\n- 1.21.8\n- 1.21.9\n- 1.21.10\n- 1.21.11\n- 26.1\n- 26.1.1\n- 26.1.2\n- 26.2\n- 26.3\n\n### Changes\n\n- Added Stonecutter multi-version support.\n- Added dedicated builds for all supported Minecraft versions.\n- Added automatic Java 21/25 toolchain selection.\n- Added multi-version regression testing and jar verification.\n- Verified the offhand protection mixin across both 1.21.x and 26.x.\n- Preserved the slot synchronization fix introduced in 1.0.1.\n\n### Testing\n\n- All 9 supported versions build successfully.\n- 36 regression scenarios passed.\n- Development clients were tested on 1.21.8, 1.21.11, 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3.\n- Release jars were verified successfully.\n\nMake sure to download the jar matching your Minecraft version."
		}
